    "title": "Charlotte healthcare jobs: veterinary, nursing, CNA and LPN openings",
    "text": "21 hours ago Charlotte’s healthcare openings range from animal care to acute hospital nursing and long-term care support. GoodVets is hiring a Veterinary Technician focused on clinical support for pets, while Mercy Restorative Care Hospital Inc and Novant Health are both seeking registered nurses in different settings, with Novant’s role centered on a Level IV NICU. Southminster’s CNA/Med Tech position is for hands-on resident care and daily support, and Liberty Health’s Licensed Practical Nurse opening serves Briar Creek at The Barclay with duties tied to supervised nursing services and geriatric care.\nVeterinary Technician\nGoodVets · 3d ago\nCharlotte, NC\nFull Time\n$16-$20/hr Me Registered Nurse (RN)\nMercy Restorative Care Hospital Inc · 3d ago\nCharlotte, NC\nFull Time\n$30-$44/hr So CNA/ Med Tech\nSouthminster · 4d ago\nCharlotte, NC\nFull Time LICENSED PRACTICAL NURSE - BRIAR CREEK at THE BARCLAY\nLiberty Health · 4d ago\nCharlotte, NC\nFull Time Registered Nurse - NICU Part Time\nNovant Health · 7d ago\nCharlotte, NC\nPart Time More Jobs Nearby View All Registered Nurse Search",
    "summary": "21 hours ago Charlotte’s healthcare openings range from animal care to acute hospital nursing and long-term care support. GoodVets is hiring a Veterinary Technician focused on clinical support for pets, while Mercy Restorative Care Hospital Inc and Novant Health are both seeking registered nurses in different settings, with Novant’s role centered on a Level IV NICU. Southminster’s CNA/Med Tech position is for hands-on resident care and daily support, and Liberty Health’s Licensed Practical Nurse opening serves Briar Creek at The Barclay with duties tied to supervised nursing services and geriatric care.",
